DWS research source artifact

This distribution contains Python source imported from SGLang 0.5.10.
SGLang: https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang
Copyright and license notices embedded in the source remain in force.
The upstream Apache License, Version 2.0 is included in LICENSE.

DWS modifications include denoising instrumentation, prediction adapters,
cost profiling/calibration, request scheduling and serving metrics.
Packaging makes external paths configurable and consolidates predictor
training and quantization into standalone scripts.
Modified engine files carry a DWS modification notice.

No ownership is asserted over the upstream engine, third-party algorithms,
pretrained model weights, tokenizers or conversation datasets.
